{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "autoEstCont 会自动估计污染比例，但它是基于 soup 中高表达且为某群体标记基因的基因，在 cluster 层面计算污染比例。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The idea of this method is that genes that are highly expressed in the soup and are marker genes for some population can be used to estimate the background contamination. Marker genes are identified using the tfidf method (see quickMarkers). The contamination fraction is then calculated at the cluster level for each of these genes"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 clusters=absent，因此当前状态缺少 autoEstCont 在 cluster 层面估计所需的聚类信息。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:clusters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供 count_matrix=droplet UMI counts，这可以作为 SoupX 处理 droplet 单细胞测量的输入，但仅有该计数矩阵本身不能替代聚类信息。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:count_matrix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "聚类信息在减法方法中被推荐提供，以便在细胞间共享信息；它不是必需输入，也不会阻止执行。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "As expression data is highly sparse at the single cell level, it is highly recommended that clustering information be provided to allow the subtraction method to share information between cells."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：该推荐针对 adjustCounts 的 subtraction 方法，不能直接等同于 autoEstCont 的输入要求；autoEstCont 的 cluster 层面计算来自其方法描述。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你是否有可用的聚类标签或聚类结果可以提供给 SoupX？",
    "missing_field": "cluster_labels",
    "why_needed": "autoEstCont 在 cluster 层面计算污染比例，缺少聚类信息会影响能否按该方法描述完成自动估计；需要确认是否补充聚类标签。"
  }
}
